# Options Advisor — setup & bootstrap

## User says "follow readmefirst.txt" (or fresh install / new laptop / new VM)

1. Read **`readmefirst.txt`** at repo root and execute **Section 3** fully.
2. Run `python scripts/validate_setup_sync.py` and `deploy/azure/Test-EnvironmentSetup.ps1`.
3. Do not ask the user to paste long prompts — secrets and Azure Portal values only.

## When adding tables, scheduler jobs, or deploy scripts

Before finishing the task, read **`deploy/azure/MAINTAIN-SETUP.md`** and update every applicable row (schema, archive registry, config, scheduler, readmefirst, setup scripts, setup-manifest).

Run `python scripts/validate_setup_sync.py` and fix failures.

## Canonical sources

| Concern | File |
|---------|------|
| Bootstrap entry | `readmefirst.txt` |
| Greenfield install | `deploy/azure/setup-new-environment.ps1` |
| Verification | `deploy/azure/Test-EnvironmentSetup.ps1`, `scripts/validate_setup_sync.py` |
| Archive tables | `database/archive_registry.py` |
| Table list | `database/schema.py` → `list_tables()` |

Update **`readmefirst.txt` "Last updated"** date when bootstrap or automation schedule changes.
